<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners heavy buyers of SAfrica bonds last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners heavy buyers of SAfrica bonds last week.</headline>
<text>
<p>JOHANNESBURG, March 17 (Reuter) Foreigners were net buyers of South African bonds last week, latest Bond Exchange of South Africa figures show.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand):</p>
<p>				   Week to March 14  Year to date</p>
<p>    - purchases		10,463.27	   70,552.59</p>
<p>    - sales		     8,492.52	   65,977.13</p>
<p>    - net purchases (sales) 1,970.75	    4,575.45</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
